            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Devkitty 1.0.0 (build 285)</h2>
<h3>Smoother tabs (build 285)</h3>
<ul>
<li>New tabs grow in and closed tabs shrink out smoothly. Tabs next to them slide instead of jumping. Tab group chips change width smoothly.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Failed checks and group line fixes (build 284)</h3>
<ul>
<li>Pull request cards show the red failed icon when checks fail, for GitHub, GitLab and Bitbucket.</li>
<li>Tab groups: the group color line hides while the attention snake runs around the group, so the two no longer overlap.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
